{
  "summary": "This reconstructed Florida Hurricane Catastrophe Fund operational StatPlan form defines the FHCF-D1A Personal Lines Residential annual data call, including annual cadence and a December 31 filing deadline for the 12-month period ending September 30. It also states submission-time validation rules and requires aggregate Coverage A reconciliation within 0.5% to the insurer\u2019s NAIC Annual Statement Schedule P value. Record-layout tables and code-list values were deliberately not extracted because they are owned by the deterministic wire-format parser.",
